      body: "Pandemic is the game that taught a generation what a co-operative board game could be. You and your team are disease-fighting specialists racing around a world map to treat outbreaks and research cures for four spreading plagues before any of them get out of control. Everyone wins or loses together, and the tension comes from the board fighting back: cities flare up, infections chain into terrifying cascades, and the deck itself is a ticking clock. Each role has a unique power, so the puzzle is coordinating the whole table into one plan. Quick to learn, endlessly tense and a proven gateway into deeper co-ops, Pandemic remains a cornerstone every collection should have.",
