      short: 'The deluxe drafting party game: Sushi Go Party!, a fast, family-friendly card game for 2–8 players.',
      body: "Sushi Go Party! super-sizes the pocket favourite into a bright, customisable buffet for up to eight players. You draft sushi cards from a hand, keep one and pass the rest, building sets of dumplings, sashimi, tempura and more that score in cheeky, interlocking ways over three rounds — and don't forget to save room for dessert. The party edition lets you swap dishes in and out to tune the menu, so no two games taste the same. It is quick, colourful and delightfully cute, teaches in a couple of minutes and welcomes kids and grandparents alike. One of the best light drafting games for a big, mixed table, and a reliable crowd-pleaser at any gathering.",
